k\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fabb5bd6ddfe85a3\" href=\"?note=fabb5bd6ddfe85a3\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8InverseLimitSpace}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8InverseLimitSpace}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8InverseLimitSpace}_S(L,I,\\leq_I,\\mathcal X,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11InverseLimitCarrier}_S(L,I,\\leq_I,\\mathcal X,\\pi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8InverseLimitSpace}_S(L,I,\\leq_I,\\mathcal X,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11InverseLimitCarrier}_S(L,I,\\leq_I,\\mathcal X,\\pi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This legacy label denotes the inverse-limit carrier; it delegates to the fully typed inverse-system definition instead of repeating a weaker formula.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier.md","status":"resolved","id":"fabb5bd6ddfe85a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrie